\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thee, Jesus, full of truth and grace,
\par Thee, Saviour, we adore,
\par Thee in affliction's furnace praise,
\par And magnify Thy power.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy power, in human weakness shown,
\par Shall make us all entire;
\par We now Thy guardian presence own,
\par And walk unburned in fire.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thee, Son of Man, by faith we see,
\par And glory in our Guide;
\par Surrounded and upheld by Thee,
\par The fiery  test abide.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The fire our graces shall refine,
\par Till, moulded from above,
\par We bear the character divine,
\par The stamp of perfect love.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

